        "ts": "1739805168.596319",
        "client_msg_id": "00b6031d-8b5d-4b73-9248-97eda1bc3bd5",
        "text": "That's \"Let things live side-by-side\" on Gordon's list at the end of the article. Not breaking the ecosystem, but growing a new one besides it. In the cases you cite, the new one ultimately became the dominant one, and the prior one withered away.",
